公元年四月，秦康公曰：「昔文公之入也無衞，故有呂、郤之患。」乃多與公子雍衞。太子母繆嬴日夜抱太子以號泣於朝，曰：「先君何罪？其嗣亦何罪？舍適而外求君，將安置此？」出朝，則抱以適趙盾所，頓首曰：「先君奉此子而屬之子，曰『此子材，吾受其賜；不材，吾怨子』。今君卒，言猶在耳，而棄之，若何？」趙盾與諸大夫皆患繆嬴，且畏誅，乃背所迎而立太子夷皋，是爲靈公。發兵以距秦送公子雍者。趙盾爲將，往撃秦，敗之令狐。先蔑、隨會亡奔秦。秋，齊、宋、衞、鄭、曹、許君皆會趙盾，盟於扈，以靈公初立故也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000412","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"秦康公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000405","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0034","start":34,"end":37,"surface":"公子雍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000406","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0039","start":39,"end":44,"surface":"太子母繆嬴","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001773","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"趙盾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000407","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0144","start":144,"end":146,"surface":"趙盾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000407","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0152","start":152,"end":154,"surface":"繆嬴","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001773","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0165","start":165,"end":169,"surface":"太子夷皋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000412","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0172","start":172,"end":174,"surface":"靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000412","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0181","start":181,"end":184,"surface":"公子雍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000406","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0186","start":186,"end":188,"surface":"趙盾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000407","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0200","start":200,"end":202,"surface":"先蔑","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001766","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0203","start":203,"end":205,"surface":"隨會","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000408","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0211","start":211,"end":223,"surface":"齊、宋、衞、鄭、曹、許君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0224","start":224,"end":225,"surface":"會","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000408","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0225","start":225,"end":227,"surface":"趙盾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000407","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0233","start":233,"end":235,"surface":"靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000412","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p084","text":"四年，伐秦，取少梁。秦亦取晉之郩。六年，秦康公伐晉，取羈馬。晉侯怒，使趙盾、趙穿、郤缺撃秦，大戰河曲，趙穿最有功。七年，晉六卿患隨會之在秦，常爲晉亂，乃詳令魏壽餘反晉降秦。秦使隨會之魏，因執會以歸晉。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m084-0020","start":20,"end":23,"surface":"秦康公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000405","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m084-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"趙盾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000407","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m084-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"趙穿","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000411","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m084-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"郤缺","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001774","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m084-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"趙穿","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000411","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m084-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"六卿","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m084-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"隨會","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000408","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m084-0078","start":78,"end":81,"surface":"魏壽餘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001775","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m084-0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"隨會","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000408","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m084-0095","start":95,"end":96,"surface":"會","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000408","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p086","text":"十四年，靈公壯，侈，厚斂以彫牆。從臺上彈人，觀其避丸也。宰夫胹熊蹯不熟，靈公怒，殺宰夫，使婦人持其尸出棄之，過朝。趙盾、隨會前數諫，不聽；已又見死人手，二人前諫。隨會先諫，不聽。靈公患之，使鉏麑刺趙盾。盾閨門開，居處節，鉏麑退，嘆曰：「殺忠臣，棄君命，罪一也。」遂觸樹而死。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m086-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000412","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m086-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"宰夫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001776","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m086-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000412","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m086-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"宰夫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001776","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m086-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"婦人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m086-0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"趙盾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000407","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m086-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"隨會","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000408","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m086-0081","start":81,"end":83,"surface":"隨會","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000408","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m086-0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000412","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m086-0095","start":95,"end":97,"surface":"鉏麑","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001777","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m086-0098","start":98,"end":100,"surface":"趙盾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000407","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m086-0101","start":101,"end":102,"surface":"盾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000407","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m086-0110","start":110,"end":112,"surface":"鉏麑","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001777","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p095","text":"三年，楚莊王圍鄭，鄭告急晉。晉使荀林父將中軍，隨會將上軍，趙朔將下軍，郤克、欒書、先縠、韓厥、鞏朔佐之。六月，至河。聞楚已服鄭，鄭伯肉袒與盟而去，荀林父欲還。先縠曰：「凡來救鄭，不至不可，將率離心。」卒度河。楚已服鄭，欲飲馬于河爲名而去。楚與晉軍大戰。鄭新附楚，畏之，反助楚攻晉。晉軍敗，走河，爭度，船中人指甚衆。楚虜我將智罃。歸而林父曰：「臣爲督將，軍敗當誅，請死。」景公欲許之。隨會曰：「昔文公之與楚戰城濮，成王歸殺子玉，而文公乃喜。今楚已敗我師，又誅其將，是助楚殺仇也。」乃止。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000257","status":"contextual_provisional","note":"覆核更正：原連cbr-p000398楚成王；本提及是同句楚莊王的王，改連cbr-p000257。提及ID、字位及原文不變。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0016","start":16,"end":19,"surface":"荀林父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001760","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id"