","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001155","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0191","start":191,"end":193,"surface":"隨會","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000408","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0197","start":197,"end":199,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0206","start":206,"end":208,"surface":"成王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000398","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0210","start":210,"end":212,"surface":"子玉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001751","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0214","start":214,"end":216,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p098","text":"六年，楚伐宋，宋來告急晉，晉欲救之，伯宗謀曰：「楚，天方開之，不可當。」乃使解揚紿爲救宋。鄭人執與楚，楚厚賜，使反其言，令宋急下。解揚紿許之，卒致晉君言。楚欲殺之，或諫，乃歸解揚。七年，晉使隨會滅赤狄。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m098-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"伯宗","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001786","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m098-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"解揚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001787","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m098-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"解揚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001787","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m098-0082","start":82,"end":84,"surface":"或諫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m098-0087","start":87,"end":89,"surface":"解揚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001787","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m098-0095","start":95,"end":97,"surface":"隨會","kind":"person",